    "sentence_translations": [
      "Eating with Chinese people",
      "",
      "If your Chinese friends treat you to a meal, what do you need to pay attention to?",
      "First, you need to prepare a small gift, for example some fruit or snack.",
      "If you are going to eat at your friend’s home, giving a bunch of flowers is also a good choice.",
      "Second, don’t keep on eating just one dish, or put too much food in your bowl while having dinner.",
      "If you eat too much, perhaps others won’t be able to try that dish.",
      "Third, if the dish you want to eat is far away from you, you can ask someone to help you.",
      "Don’t stand up and try to reach it.",
      ""
    ]
  }
